variable C3${dir} equal 0.5*(${C3neg}+${C3pos})
variable C31 equal 0.5*(${C3neg}+${C3pos})
variable C31 equal 0.5*(156.386536092087+${C3pos})
variable C31 equal 0.5*(156.386536092087+165.638926593894)
variable C4${dir} equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(5.81056111650185+${C4pos})
